      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزَّانٌ</span></b>  One <i>who stores up wheat,</i> or <i>food:</i> of the
dial. of Egypt. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَازِنٌ</span>. ＝   
